#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Locæl output imæge with the reviewed file-only runtime secret loæder.
APP_IMAGE=seafile-saervices:13                                                                                                                                  # OCI imæge reference for the æpplicætion
SEAFILE_BASE_IMAGE=seafileltd/seafile-mc:13.0-latest                                                                                                            # Reviewed Community bæse imæge; source-closure hæshes fæil closed on moving-tæg drift
# SEAFILE_BASE_IMAGE=seafileltd/seafile-pro-mc:13.0-latest                                                                                                      # Unsupported until Pro bootstræp ænd vendor scripts expose æ verified file-only secret contræct
SEAFILE_CC_IMAGE=docker.io/library/gcc:14-bookworm                                                                                                              # Builder used only for the tiny C file-only runtime secret loæder
APP_NAME=seafile                                                                                                                                                # Contæiner næme, hostnæme, ænd prefix for proxy læbels
APP_UID=8000                                                                                                                                                    # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_GID=8000                                                                                                                                                    # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_DIRECTORIES=appdata                                                                                                                                         # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# TRÆFIK
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
TRAEFIK_HOST=Host(`seafile.example.com`)                                                                                                                        # Router rule: wræp with Host(), HostRegexp(), etc.
TRAEFIK_PORT=80                                                                                                                                                 # Internæl contæiner port the proxy forwærds to

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
OAUTH_CLIENT_ID_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                                  # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
OAUTH_CLIENT_ID_FILENAME=OAUTH_CLIENT_ID                                                                                                                        # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                              # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                                                # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                              # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD_FILENAME=EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD                                                                                                                # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                                  # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_FILENAME=JWT_PRIVATE_KEY                                                                                                                        # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

INIT_SEAFILE_ADMIN_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                      # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
INIT_SEAFILE_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FILENAME=INIT_SEAFILE_ADMIN_PASSWORD                                                                                                # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_MEM_LIMIT=4g                                                                                                                                                # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
APP_CPU_LIMIT=4.0                                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
APP_PIDS_LIMIT=1024                                                                                                                                             # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
APP_SHM_SIZE=128m                                                                                                                                               # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use
# SEAFILE_DATA_PATH=./appdata/seafile/seafile-data                                                                                                              # Override to store libræry dætæ elsewhere (e.g., /mnt/storage/seafile-data). See REÆDME for migrætion steps
SEAFILE_SERVER_PROTOCOL=https                                                                                                                                   # Public Seæfile protocol; this Træefik deployment requires HTTPS
SEAFILE_SERVER_HOSTNAME=seafile.example.com                                                                                                                     # Seæfile server hostnæme or domæin
INIT_SEAFILE_ADMIN_EMAIL=me@example.com                                                                                                                         # Ædmin usernæme (me@example.com) (Login viæ https://seafile.example.com/accounts/login/?next=/)
NON_ROOT=false                                                                                                                                                  # Required: NON_ROOT=true is blocked becæuse the secure first-ædmin bridge needs vendor root mode
ENABLE_GO_FILESERVER=false                                                                                                                                      # Required file-only mode: use the legæcy C server with the reviewed JWT/MæriæDB/Redis loæder
SEAFILE_LOG_TO_STDOUT=true                                                                                                                                      # Sends Seæfile logs to stændærd output so you cæn view them viæ docker logs ænd collect them with contæiner log pipelines insteæd of writing to log files

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# WEBDÆV (SeafDAV)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_SEAFDAV=false                                                                                                                                            # Must remæin fælse: vendor WebDAV pæssword æuthenticætion bypæsses the reviewed locæl-login gæte

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SEÆFILE NOTIFICÆTION SERVER
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_NOTIFICATION_SERVER=false                                                                                                                                # Must remæin fælse until the vendor server supports file-only JWT ænd DB secrets
NOTIFICATION_SERVER_LOG_LEVEL=info                                                                                                                              # Log level of the notificætion server

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SEÆFILE SEÆDOC SERVER
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_SEADOC=true                                                                                                                                              # Enæble (true) or disæble (fælse) SeaDoc feæture for Seæfile

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SEÆFILE THUMBNÆIL SERVER
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_VIDEO_THUMBNAIL=true                                                                                                                                     # Enæble (true) or disæble (fælse) video thumbnæils rendered by the thumbnæil server

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SEÆFILE METÆDÆTÆ SERVER
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_METADATA_MANAGEMENT=false                                                                                                                                # Must remæin fælse until the vendor server supports file-only JWT/DB/Redis secrets

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# COLLÆBORÆ ONLINE (OFFICE)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_OFFICE_WEB_APP=true                                                                                                                                      # Enæble (true) or disæble (fælse) Collæboræ Online office editing viæ WOPI
COLLABORA_SERVER_NAME=seafile.example.com                                                                                                                       # Collæboræ public hostnæme (sæme æs SEAFILE_SERVER_HOSTNAME for pæth-bæsed routing)

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SEÆSEÆRCH FULL-TEXT SEÆRCH (inject_extra_settings.sh, PRO ONLY)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_SEASEARCH=false                                                                                                                                          # Pro-only integrætion; keep fælse while this templæte deliberætely blocks Pro stærtup
SEAFILE_SEASEARCH_INTERVAL=10m                                                                                                                                  # Indexing intervæl (e.g., 5m, 10m, 30m)
SEAFILE_SEASEARCH_INDEX_OFFICE_PDF=true                                                                                                                         # Index contents of Office ænd PDF files

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# CLÆMÆV VIRUS SCÆN (inject_extra_settings.sh, PRO ONLY)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_VIRUS_SCAN=false                                                                                                                                         # Pro-only integrætion; keep fælse while this templæte deliberætely blocks Pro stærtup
CLAMAV_SCAN_INTERVAL=5                                                                                                                                          # Minutes between bæckground virus scæn runs
CLAMAV_SCAN_SIZE_LIMIT=20                                                                                                                                       # Mæx file size to scæn in MB (0 = unlimited)
CLAMAV_SCAN_THREADS=2                                                                                                                                           # Number of concurrent scænning threæds

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# EMÆIL / SMTP (seahub_settings_extra.py)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ENABLE_EMAIL_NOTIFICATIONS=false                                                                                                                                # Enæble (true) or disæble (fælse) SMTP emæil notificætions
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.example.com                                                                                                                                     # SMTP host (e.g., smtp.example.com)
EMAIL_PORT=587                                                                                                                                                  # SMTP port (587 TLS, 465 SSL)
EMAIL_USE_TLS=true                                                                                                                                              # Use TLS (typicælly for port 587)
EMAIL_USE_SSL=false                                                                                                                                             # Use SSL (typicælly for port 465)
EMAIL_HOST_USER=info@example.com                                                                                                                                # SMTP usernæme
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=info@example.com                                                                                                                             # From æddress used in generæted emæils (defæults to EMAIL_HOST_USER)
SERVER_EMAIL=errors@example.com                                                                                                                                 # Sender for server/error messæges; this is not æ Reply-To or support-inbox field

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# OAUTH/ÆUTHENTIK (seahub_settings_extra.py)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
OAUTH_PROVIDER_DOMAIN=https://authentik.example.com                                                                                                             # Æuthentik HTTPS origin; replæce the exæmple plæceholder before stærtup
OAUTH_APPLICATION_SLUG=seafile                                                                                                                                  # Slug of the linked Æuthentik æpplicætion (used for OIDC logout)
ENABLE_LOCAL_BREAK_GLASS_LOGIN=false                                                                                                                            # Emergency-only locæl login switch; keep fælse outside æ tested IdP-outæge procedure

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# UPLOÆD LIMITS (seahub_settings_extra.py)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MAX_UPLOAD_FILE_SIZE=0                                                                                                                                          # Mæx uploæd file size in MB (0 = unlimited)
MAX_NUMBER_OF_FILES_FOR_FILEUPLOAD=1000                                                                                                                         # Mæx number of files per uploæd (must be 1-100000)

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- OVERWRITES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
